# Manager Agent

Implement `run()` → `{ decision: PASS|FAIL, reasons, response }`.

- Call `app.security.governance` (`validate_output`, injection, auth, etc.).
- No LLM, no Qdrant, no SQL.
- Empty sources or ungrounded text → `FAIL` with reasons.
- Refuse implementing other agents.
